                "width": 48,
                "height": 5,
                "widget": {
                    "title": "",
                    "text": {
                        "content": "## \ud83d\udcb0 Prompt Caching & FinOps Cost Efficiency  `[v3.3-final \u2022 Complete Edition]`\nVisual Donut cost breakdown, True Cache Hit Ratio scorecards, Dual-Axis Cache Read vs Write efficiency, and FinOps Break-Even Economics.\n\n**Suite Navigation:** 00 Usage Summary | 01 Fable 5 Deep-Dive | 02 Fleet Overview | 03 Latency & SLOs | 04 Errors & Reliability | **[05 Caching & FinOps]** | 06 Capacity & Quota  \n*Features: Multi-Dimensional Interactive Filters \u2022 Ratio Scorecards \u2022 Donut Shares \u2022 Dual-Axis Correlation \u2022 Live Data Tables \u2022 SRE/FinOps Playbooks*",
                        "format": "MARKDOWN",
                        "style": {
                            "backgroundColor": "#0A2E1A",
                            "textColor": "#E0E0E0",
                            "fontSize": "FS_MEDIUM",
                            "padding": "P_MEDIUM",
                            "horizontalAlignment": "H_LEFT",
                            "verticalAlignment": "V_CENTER"
                        }
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "xPos": 0,
                "yPos": 5,
                "width": 48,
                "height": 4,
                "widget": {
                    "title": "\ud83d\udd11 24h Caching Scorecards & True Hit Ratios",
                    "sectionHeader": {
                        "subtitle": "Direct comparison of discounted cache reads vs full-price uncached input and cache write overhead",
                        "dividerBelow": true
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "xPos": 0,
                "yPos": 9,
                "width": 12,
                "height": 13,
                "widget": {
                    "title": "\ud83d\udc9a Cache read tokens (24h) \u2014 90% discount",
                    "scorecard": {
                        "timeSeriesQuery": {
                            "timeSeriesFilter": {
                                "filter": "metric.type=\"aiplatform.googleapis.com/publisher/online_serving/token_count\" resource.type=\"aiplatform.googleapis.com/PublisherModel\" resource.label.\"publisher\"=\"anthropic\" metric.label.\"type\"=\"cache_read_input\"",
                                "aggregation": {
                                    "alignmentPeriod": "86400s",
                                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_SUM",
                                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        "sparkChartView": {
                            "sparkChartType": "SPARK_LINE"
                        }
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "xPos": 12,
                "yPos": 9,
                "width": 12,
                "height": 13,
                "widget": {
                    "title": "\ud83d\udd34 Uncached input tokens (24h) \u2014 100% price",
